{"id":"n61013-3-9","stage":2,"title":"내놓다 · 腾出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61013-3-9-1","ko":"집을 파시는 건가요?","zh":"您是要卖房子吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집을","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집을","audio":"/audio/cd6aaeb8eea1e3b476ad.mp3"}},{"text":"파시는","meaning":"卖，出售","explanation":"팔다：卖，出售；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"팔다","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71482","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파시는","audio":"/audio/ddd169c0c718542ef417.mp3"}},{"text":"건가요?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건가요","audio":"/audio/d23ae34a616ec8bb1263.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"2aa6e349da8a806d","term":"팔다","zh":"卖，出售","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3","entryId":"71482","definition":"收取钱财将物品或权利交给对方或提供劳动力等。","pronunciation":["팔다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/c23a196a692e23fea75e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61013-3-9-2","ko":"아니요. 전세로 내놓는 거예요.","zh":"不是，是要以全租方式出租（交大笔押金，通常不付月租）。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","au